# Generated artifacts that scripts compare byte for byte are pinned to LF.
#
# The contract is "the same input never changes a single byte", so if line endings are
# translated at checkout time, a plain clone is enough to make the comparison disagree with the
# recorded output and fail. (Hit for real on Windows with core.autocrlf=true.)
#
# **When you add a new artifact that is compared byte for byte, add it here too.**
data/bedrock/SOURCE.json text eol=lf
src/data/texture-frames.json text eol=lf
